# RapidR Studio for the web: response headers for hosts that read this file
# (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages). docs/security-audit.md SEC-17.
#
# index.html carries its own Content-Security-Policy (a meta tag); the header
# adds what only a header can say: no other site may put Studio in a frame.
# No CORS: run.html, the program's sandboxed frame, gets the runtime from
# Studio by message, never by fetching it. No Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy:
# that frame's opaque origin loads the program's pictures from here.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
/
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
/index.html
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
